# FISHER-VIEW-1: the closed site with the fisher rule on (FISHER-1f on main). Tutorial/02Trade01,
# player 2, type 810 at origin (242, 217), rotation 1 (both entrances on land; docs/re/fisher.md
# sections 10-11; the History Edition's ui_5.mp4, FISHER-HE-1 step A). The click is the 4 x 3
# footprint's centre tile (243, 218). The worker goes out (sim: tick 690), never comes home: at
# its release (sim: tick 19720) workers_out is 0 again and raw and output are still 0; then a
# second worker is sent (sim: tick 19890), and the stock stays 0.
# Launch: --play {game}/Scenes/Tutorial/02Trade01.sze --player 2 --fisher-rules on --speed 200
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 242 217
wait frames 5
key b
wait frames 3
select 810
rotate 1
expect title build 810
click 243 218
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
expect fact inspection.type == 810
expect fact inspection.kind == Farm
wait fact inspection.workers_out == 1 within 60000
checkpoint worker_out
wait fact inspection.workers_out == 0 within 120000
checkpoint released
expect fact inspection.raw_88 == 0
expect fact inspection.out_88 == 0
wait fact inspection.workers_out == 1 within 60000
checkpoint second_worker
expect fact inspection.raw_88 == 0
expect fact inspection.out_88 == 0
quit
